  "text.761b7ad8ad439b2855fc": "summary",
  "text.caa6acb626df8f417844": "Capacity and component supply constrain near-term output. 800G revenue $12.8m in Q2 is still small versus total sales; 1.6T qualification and delivery dates remain conditional. Do not convert space leased or nameplate output into recognized revenue.",
  "text.bc1dc1c56bb7118dcac0": "Formal guidance, qualitative outlook, aspirations, revisions and pending outcomes remain distinct. Beat rates are not a cross-company competence ranking.",
