  "text.697b35c8051946e5744f": "Not a complete historical record of all statements or every intraperiod update. No claim that no other revisions existed.",
  "text.e6e89b23e8cf39f2261a": "Published revenue precision ranges from $0.1m releases to $0.001m filing detail; no material range outcome depends on precision.",
  "text.eef3c3e1e01b15294507": "Quarterly outlook net-income/EPS use company-specific non-GAAP tax and exclusions; they are not GAAP EBIT margin targets.",
  "text.f9e53ef695f2e045d0a6": "methodology",
  "text.8429d7816c1d8f961093": "methodology · 4 fields",
  "text.ca00fccfb408989eddc4": "error",
