  "text.994d5bd68ab45c9d8117": "Calendar years",
  "text.1765ddd401dacb7fb667": "scale Caution",
  "text.3325f84da875f275c09c": "Maturity scale is an output, not an independently verified market forecast. Bull cases are stresses, not probability-weighted recommendations. Require addressable-market, share, customer and capital feasibility checks.",
  "text.f740d4fab7caa7a12fe7": "2026 anchor uses management ~$1.1bn, then 2027–2029 capacity ramp and utilization improve. $2.75bn in 2027 requires very substantial volume conversion; high uncertainty and financing gate remain.",
  "text.76f959940c208e811f5a": "annual Forecast · 15 records",
  "text.930b42d9fe1817da06c7": "Five-year successful domestic automation, new hyperscalers and higher-margin 1.6T/CPO; unusually large scale requires product and capital-allocation success.",
