  "text.87aef0b3d970a370df64": "g / terminal ROIC of NOPAT; terminal capital efficiency reconciled with margin/tax",
  "text.3e4ce1624dd171167a8c": "sales To Capital Fade",
  "text.3ce10a6b86e6cb788723": "After the explicitly specified capital-efficiency years, fade linearly to terminal ROIC / [terminal EBIT margin × (1 − normalized tax)] by the last forecast year.",
