  "text.def1fc2b3f1af112ad33": "2026 anchor is approximate management outlook, not actuals. The 2027–2029 ramp to $2.75bn/$4.4bn/$5.94bn is conditional on qualification, yields and paid shipments; no formal matching issuer revenue guide.",
  "text.427b40ea9e24897ada61": "our inference/judgment, unless specific issuer forecast identified",
  "text.eb36a58f1000f48ba524": "base Inputs · 3 records",
  "text.dcb55e6d924cb9389741": "Operating losses persist even on the presentation’s adjusted basis; assume staged operating leverage only after ramp utilization.",
  "text.4573d809177562a3cd64": "Sales-to-capital",
  "text.9bf4aef097fda4fc7ea4": "H1 PPE cash, land and capital prepayments total $633.5m. Future spend, depreciation and supplier funding need a separate schedule.",
