  "text.98b4222655f58c67cf92": "The 2026 bridge is a June-to-December liquidity roll-forward. It is separate from 2027–2036 FCFF and is not the full future FCFF stub at October 17. For an October 17 valuation, estimate cash at that date using post-June actual/known transactions and cash use, then include only remaining October 17–December 31 FCFF. Never charge July–October cash uses twice or add June cash plus raises as current excess cash. The disclosed June balance and full H2 envelope bracket rather than verify current cash.",
