  "text.63c356b5be4443d91603": "Peak cumulative undiscounted economic FCFF deficit since forecast year 1. Excludes starting cash, financing, debt service and reserves; scenario outcome, never an added debt deduction.",
  "text.29a4102eed9021c3b460": "funded Status",
  "text.31260919073031c0f991": "not_established",
  "text.60c411b2baec2ab58d44": "treatment",
  "text.71dfefc5c73af3ffe76f": "Scenario deficit is already in FCFF. Never add it to debt or deduct it again from operating EV. Financing proceeds are not operating income.",
  "text.a9df4ad32bf40598ee95": "selected Source Funding Outcomes",
