  "text.0d00e65b4328a846d5fd": "peak Deficit · 3 fields",
  "text.7f8b149bc37bd83a83c3": "Cumulative undiscounted shortfall from 2027 in the specified modeled flow; excludes 2026, starting cash, new financing, interest, principal repayment, liquidity reserve and award withholding. Not a debt claim.",
  "text.4d77fe2ef344cda43484": "peak Liquidity Deficit Before Financing And Award Withholding",
