  "text.3ee3b9edd4a43deb9d43": "bounded Model Gaps",
  "text.d1d5b00ce947cb2e46ea": "bounded Model Gaps · 4 records",
  "text.e3db0a395b3989fe394f": "Valuation-date stub and post-anchor cash/claims/share roll-forward not integrated; this is a forecast-origin operating EV, not October 17 equity value.",
  "text.871944c3fc03b5c61a76": "No probability weighting or share-price calibration. Source forecast assumptions are judgments, not reported facts.",
  "text.fc8dc324ccd151f000ba": "Enterprise-to-equity bridge is not computed here; consult the company-specific claim register for resolved evidence, assumptions and remaining uncertainties. Zero is not evidence of absence.",
  "text.dd07b36b373c6c3f41ea": "FY2026 forecast anchor requires October 17–December 31 FCFF stub and consistent additional discount interval before any October 17 valuation. June-to-December liquidity envelope is not the remaining stub.",
  "text.d4141ff34928061ce979": "v20Compatibility",
