  "text.afdf34d2d959e808ce6a": "required Changes",
  "text.1169dc0f8a447b63ac5a": "required Changes · 4 records",
  "text.468beb6f96986cb074c7": "Versioned direct annual schedule input and durable import/save/restore; do not substitute a flexible-profile-generated path.",
  "text.81d0baf85b4911f7f5fd": "Operating-only calculation independent of cash, debt and shares, with equity/claims gates retained.",
  "text.9f092e3fb1c25dab0618": "Resolve first-year scalar growth bound without changing 150%/200% annual growth. A core-only bounded unused scalar is a technical fixture, not a permissible silent UI workaround.",
  "text.ed5667abf84ed5e99257": "Versioned management-forecast anchor kind and as-of stub adapter; never label this anchor actual TTM.",
  "text.eb5801e1756cd120be7a": "Carrying value, fair value, principal and contingent exposure are distinct. An unknown amount is not zero.",
  "text.f2fb6d086c737d2537f8": "Source-reported balances and contingent-contract terms; valuation treatment remains explicitly conditional where stated.",
  "text.da0a200637c4a08a1fb5": "authoritative Company Path",
  "text.f78cb551eda0fbaf1661": "source Ledger Path",
  "text.58e59b575b30cac7e15c": "registers",
  "text.b835e7e250e7c64ae00d": "registers · 1 fields",
  "text.f3bf155e4fc71eaaa975": "integration Policy",
  "text.35776cfc758793ea3b50": "Use source-date balances only after reconciling operating cash, investments, debt/lease policy, post-balance events and share/award treatment. An unresolved value is null, not zero. A future economic funding deficit is an outcome, not additional face-value debt.",
  "text.eeac03c1c4a3aec7dcfe": "baseline reference",
  "text.8cf3f05bc895874439da": "Supporting source-derived research or explicitly dated prior comparison.",
  "text.82a3537ff0dbce7eec35": "name",
  "text.401c190bcaa2135e3014": "APPLIED OPTOELECTRONICS, INC.",
  "text.3f928a90dcd58e024716": "snapshot Id",
  "text.e7aac41796b38662fe1e": "conditional staged capacity research assumptions; not a validated fair-value estimate",
  "text.fd7bdd66be253dddda2d": "Provisional research assumptions only. A high-risk capacity-led turnaround in datacenter optics, with substantial funding needs before durable GAAP profitability.",
  "text.3df701b1e5b876b215d9": "assumptions",
  "text.bcfa154e2b982fab5bc0": "assumptions · 10 fields",
  "text.0d73b2e46f0d65fa5166": "rationale · 10 fields",
  "text.9b071898ed4ac1b3f756": "60% is year 1 growth. The staged profile then uses 40%, 30%, 20%, 15%, 10%, 8%, 5%, 3%, and 2.5% at these defaults. Quarter 3 guidance and capacity expansion support a front-loaded structure; the annual path is analyst judgment, not management guidance. Each simulated initial-growth input changes the whole same weighted path.",
  "text.6e6a5d26fe8297775d96": "12% mature GAAP EBIT margin is reached in year 6. At the reported starting loss, the staged path is −5%,0%,5%,8%,10%,12% before maturity. This is a conditional utilization and operating-leverage judgment; no non-GAAP net margin is substituted.",
  "text.e0ac9eca8fe6ae7a8e02": "25% applies only to positive modeled EBIT. This is a normalized mature rate; no tax refund or verified NOL benefit is assumed during losses.",
  "text.2cdc38b93f9e0471cd3e": "0.8x is initial incremental sales/capital, requiring $1.25 investment per $1 extra revenue in years 1–2. It rises to 1.6x by years 6–7 as capacity is used. Years 8–10 fade capital intensity toward (1 + terminal growth) × margin × (1 − tax) / terminal ROIC, ending at 1.084x at defaults to align year 10 and terminal economics. The whole path is an explicit assumption, not a reported ratio.",
  "text.6d0d66ba053692de0574": "10% assumes capital utilization improves in maturity but grants no excess return versus the high constant model discount rate.",
  "text.8cea837e51428038519a": "13.5% nominal USD is a rounded model estimate. Assumed beta 1.8 plus a 1-point extra equity allowance, 10% target debt and a 3.5-point debt spread reflect concentrated customers, execution and funding risk. These are judgments, not quoted borrowing terms.",
  "text.87defd88e0c0341dda13": "2.5% nominal USD is a mature-state assumption with limited real expansion, well below the high-growth starting rate and the discount rate; it is not a company forecast.",
  "text.3a66386005123949f082": "10 years is the common model horizon so company economics can be compared; rates and margins fade over this period. The number is a modeling convention, not a source fact.",
  "text.3fa6e535ddb964af1ab6": "0 means no additional user-entered claim beyond the separate explicit current claims model. Do not enter the same modeled claims again. The separate source-dated current claims model deducts the disclosed convertible fair-value proxy and vendor financing once, and uses an explicit intrinsic customer-warrant scenario. Counterfactual note conversion and the incomplete known-ATM pro forma are separate sensitivities. Current employee awards and warrant time value remain incomplete.",
  "text.ed415298f52d5db40467": "0 is an additional-asset assumption beyond source cash and any explicitly selected financing proceeds. It is not proof that every other nonoperating asset is absent.",
  "text.74c0f4912545576c4105": "reported Anchors",
  "text.c060307a795c0ef43d77": "reported Anchors · 2 records",
  "text.a8a7e2f4f940eee7300c": "reported or directly derived from reported current financials",
  "text.b86df5df4882e74d503e": "published At",
  "text.f864ce179ba2deffbccf": "AAOI-filing",
  "text.a8af9b3da1b075426e59": "reported results and explicitly labeled management outlook; not the base-case forecast",
  "text.982d9e3eb996f559e633": "text",
  "text.44a753547f96e3c8bd47": "Q2 2026 revenue was $191.9m; GAAP gross margin was 27.7% and GAAP net loss $22.8m. Q3 revenue guidance was $255–290m.",
