  "text.2278009f3a6a6f69a84c": "For 2030 onward, explicitly derive capex from D&A plus growth-asset cash investment and operating WC. Fade total net investment coefficient to (1+g) / 0.9777778 = 1.048295 by 2036; this aligns the current-year revenue increment with forward-funded NOPAT*g/ROIC, matching original 11% terminal ROIC / 15% EBIT / 25% tax. D&A reaches 5% of revenue; not a company target.",
