  "text.47de27dcbe427f681e9f": "Factory cash capex envelopes are analytical; no disclosed company 2027 dollar budget was found.",
  "text.866cc7d7509ab72d05c1": "2027 base output needs sustained qualification, acceptable yield, customer acceptance and working-capital turns.",
  "text.e3a1a074b20ebf33de2a": "AR concentration, supplier terms and bank acceptances can materially increase cash funding. Bank acceptances are financing if classified as debt; exclude from operating payables in that convention.",
