  "text.896400672db9e426cb04": "Dated disclosed-market-claim bridge",
  "text.264cb44020a713515e5c": "Common residual = DCF enterprise value + same-date unrestricted cash - bank debt - vendor financing - disclosed fair value of entire convertible instrument - other separately reviewed claims. Apply warrants separately.",
  "text.2f186a8b2ffcfde14b3f": "Same-date common outstanding, 74.998m or 84.386m, rounded as filed. Do not add convertible shares.",
  "text.223db46a5d0e461ebd61": "not Current",
  "text.ae507299f96f8bb07128": "June 30, 2026 note fair value is not an October 17 quote. It includes market-priced conversion optionality and depends on market stock prices, rates and credit. This conservative hybrid bridge is not a self-consistent intrinsic option valuation.",
  "text.e99f42f0b977c646f6ef": "book Value Rule",
  "text.73e650296edbe30cef42": "Replace the book convertible amount with disclosed fair value; do not subtract both.",
  "text.adb7d82f0a91f09ec6aa": "if Converted",
  "text.9f3d4141d2ce4aa01a36": "if Converted · 4 fields",
  "text.a991036ba33b808f3bca": "All-share settlement sensitivity; hypothetical, excludes option time value",
  "text.ba3549b897059c23cb44": "Remove the whole convertible claim, then add principalMillions * conversionRate / 1000 to common shares. No new cash is received on debt conversion.",
  "text.86dd58222215b1a361a8": "selection Caution",
  "text.37e76dcff5f044f6084f": "Do not automatically assume holders exchange a principal claim for shares worth less than principal. A below-strike if-converted outcome is a hypothetical settlement scenario, not a rational-holder default.",
  "text.3e0cfbeb7a82feca971e": "intrinsic Settlement Alternative",
  "text.a449d063dafe1fcc0a1f": "Ignoring time value and legal timing, common price solves value available before notes = basicShares * price + max(notePrincipal, conversionShares * price). Equivalent to lower of principal-subtraction and all-share-conversion values before floor and other option claims.",
  "text.efa91d903dcc3c825173": "principal Only",
  "text.48cf02b101ef0811b29f": "principal Only · 2 fields",
  "text.d40a1544f380420095dd": "Principal-only sensitivity; not option-inclusive valuation",
  "text.6efc8110afeb84ba8d03": "Principal is the contractual maturity amount; carrying amount includes issuance premium and unamortized costs. Neither captures the economic value of conversion optionality. Do not present either as fair value.",
