  "text.dcca0b809d0584e63114": "The disclosed 1.324233m refers to vesting at issuance. H1 2026 cash-flow statement includes $1.775m of warrant issuance/vesting value without an exact updated vested-share roll-forward; do not label the initial amount as total current vested.",
  "text.1e709522df14783faf70": "default Scenario",
  "text.e675cd6cbdd990a6fb38": "Full contractual share cap, conditional on all vesting; conservative dilution scenario, not a claim that all shares have vested.",
  "text.811e0fbf43d6f22d9976": "minimum Scenario",
  "text.ae3f87c5ccd03fd1b4c5": "Initially vested minimum count only; excludes later vesting and understates possible dilution.",
  "text.808334705d7ed7936a11": "intrinsic Exercise Formula",
  "text.c637ae3827a48595e736": "If pre-warrant equity / shares exceeds strike, price = (pre-warrant equity + strike * eligibleWarrantShares) / (shares + eligibleWarrantShares); otherwise use pre-warrant equity / shares. Floor negative equity at zero for common price.",
  "text.4d5804ac726255c6928d": "exercise Proceeds Rule",
  "text.eecf7473adf8c6927739": "Add proceeds once only if adding gross exercise shares; alternatively solve net-share dilution without a proceeds addition.",
  "text.714a885d6317b8c636df": "limits · 2 records",
  "text.8e9d6150d8919b111615": "Intrinsic exercise ignores remaining time value and vesting/settlement details; it is not current warrant fair value.",
  "text.a8dd5f1ee7c5d04c0639": "Keep reported net-revenue and GAAP SBC baseline unchanged. Avoid adding a second blanket warrant-dollar claim on top of explicit warrant dilution. Future revenue reductions and future vesting can overlap economically; full-cap sensitivity is intentionally conservative.",
