  "text.67af297a3be3ffc6fc99": "FCFF deficit is an operating-funding diagnostic, not a complete liquidity waterfall: excludes debt service, required cash buffer, timing within years and financing costs. Existing cash is not both added to value and removed from FCFF; it is shown separately for financing feasibility.",
  "text.aa0bcdcb3af362dd99ae": "suggested Sensitivities",
  "text.9aa106cec06ce909ee20": "suggested Sensitivities · 4 fields",
  "text.f47120194ba3c0a42b8d": "target Margin · 3 records",
  "text.1f2ddeb4cd5e2c53e9e0": "sales Capital · 3 records",
  "text.19974d3afad5049ab62c": "note Bridge",
  "text.b7476dd3436a72b309c6": "note Bridge · 3 records",
  "text.a931e677fdf5b0693a0c": "dated disclosed fair value",
  "text.1b79c4c8006e798be6e4": "principal-only limitation",
  "text.22bceaf627897422bec9": "if-converted hypothetical",
  "text.3c539baacbaaa5001afc": "warrant Count",
  "text.f4ee955ce07ba6210532": "warrant Count · 2 records",
  "text.ab86e5d35eed1321a805": "display Rules",
  "text.a25f3daa13b107b6606c": "display Rules · 5 records",
  "text.0bb9ed51748bdb42d475": "Show enterprise value and negative residual separately from the limited-liability common floor of $0.",
  "text.e851ebcca07438212c66": "A zero DCF residual does not mean the traded stock or abandonment/turnaround option has literally zero value.",
  "text.5690c664c0e1555f29c1": "Show peak cumulative negative FCFF and financing shortfall; no assumption that new equity can be raised without dilution.",
  "text.02b20411e8af159a2b4d": "Do not add new-financing cash without adding new shares, and do not subtract financing proceeds from FCFF.",
  "text.d4be793f961fd172f3de": "A staged illustration is more informative than the old nine-negative-year smooth fade, but remains conditional rather than fully financed.",
  "text.98f60d60a07753815781": "normalized Staged Adapter",
  "text.395607c8c73d89954da0": "normalized Staged Adapter · 24 fields",
  "text.70b9ed8f0701381bf3a6": "Recommended source-reasoned analyst shape; no market-price calibration",
  "text.61047d6c8efd896314ba": "initial Scalar Defaults",
  "text.9f9d19b837588861a3f8": "initial Scalar Defaults · 7 fields",
  "text.121e57cf33f5728983a6": "four Sampled Drivers",
  "text.133d059851fe88fcab77": "four Sampled Drivers · 4 records",
  "text.9bfe1fe63ede0caa893c": "targetMargin",
  "text.e5fed71c442034549722": "salesCapital",
  "text.0907d381a1c020a74642": "growth Weights",
  "text.fd7d094f33446783c511": "growth Weights · 10 records",
  "text.bf953de4aac0ba7a9cdf": "growth Formula",
  "text.50921b8964ac2e433020": "yearGrowth = terminalGrowth + (sampledGrowth - terminalGrowth) * growthWeight; first year equals sampled growth; last year equals stable growth.",
  "text.c8c9c6045e0f9205d27f": "margin Reference Start",
  "text.90244406c512c9ff892f": "margin Weights",
  "text.d55a58482735a857bf46": "margin Weights · 10 records",
  "text.ed9c8b2788a417430b75": "margin Formula",
  "text.a36ae54772a0620cb865": "yearMargin = actualAdjustedStartingMargin + (sampledTargetMargin - actualAdjustedStartingMargin) * marginWeight; from year 6 equals sampled target. Weights are fixed, computed once from reference TTM margin and the chosen illustration, not recomputed to erase sampled target uncertainty.",
  "text.eb9d7a0825a7b29d0c3f": "early Capital Ratio Multipliers",
  "text.d9002f5a4141182e45bd": "early Capital Ratio Multipliers · 7 records",
  "text.3cf8a2daa985b2c185d8": "capital Driver Meaning",
  "text.109923186f96d874c5f2": "Initial incremental sales/capital; 0.8x baseline. Early-stage utilization raises it toward 2 times input in years 6–7.",
  "text.22ba9c1f4ee9bf3f3dcc": "capital Terminal Fade Years",
  "text.1ebf649a0d7929d26ab2": "capital Terminal Fade Years · 3 records",
  "text.a81fa6748f873b3f9c6f": "capital Terminal Fade Weights",
  "text.702aa1176a8b84a4d7a9": "capital Terminal Fade Weights · 3 records",
  "text.0058e7efab3b700e93cb": "terminal Capital Intensity Formula",
  "text.b5a138f759a8c8bf6264": "(1 + terminalGrowth) * targetMargin * (1 - tax) / terminalROIC",
  "text.3eb492ca42e9b949e517": "late Capital Formula",
  "text.3010c5bcf4cbe8ff612e": "inverseSalesCapital = (1 - fadeWeight) / (2 * sampledSalesCapital) + fadeWeight * terminalCapitalIntensity; salesCapital = 1 / inverseSalesCapital.",
  "text.16ab9918b98f5e2e5b4d": "terminal Consistency Proof",
  "text.9e5b67566c41a72f3e28": "With constant final growth g and margin m, explicit reinvestment = (R_t - R_t-1) * (1+g)*m*(1-tax)/ROIC = NOPAT_t*g/ROIC. Thus final FCFF*(1+g) equals terminal-year NOPAT*(1-g/ROIC). The (1+g) factor matches the existing engine contemporaneous delta-sales convention to its terminal g/ROIC convention.",
  "text.c69c2b64ea117702582a": "discounting",
  "text.2ed24931e979c10d5098": "Use sampled WACC each year and same terminal WACC; taxes fixed unless user changes the scalar tax rate.",
  "text.1e2135d1b50f14d3d3d6": "controls",
  "text.388629e368e68ec328a7": "Keep scalar assumptions editable, derive overrides inside the shared current valuation path. Do not persist generated arrays as user-authored overrides. Every Monte Carlo draw must run the same adapter.",
  "text.e96f45225134feaceb9f": "zero Margin Boundary",
  "text.5cd1c2602c5249860ba3": "When targetMargin=0, terminal intensity is zero. If the existing engine requires a finite positive salesCapital override, use Number.MAX_VALUE as a documented numerical limiting representation instead of Infinity; its resulting investment is negligible at monetary precision. Deterministic and simulation must share the same convention.",
  "text.05508e6d5583c09ca32a": "default Growth",
  "text.51affd684370be686e18": "default Growth · 10 records",
  "text.0abdc2be6d91a46e8cad": "default Margin",
  "text.475184e8807a2eda83b4": "default Margin · 10 records",
  "text.d6b581f3d792414eb930": "default Sales Capital",
  "text.a9bbe4ee514300b45385": "default Sales Capital · 10 records",
  "text.c7ddeb6797c8b20e9973": "diagnostic · 11 fields",
  "text.2ae9b693468c5be80797": "terminal Next Year Fcff",
  "text.96adef870fb2174731a1": "final Year Fcff Times One Plus G",
  "text.39aadb62eb1f047e0a0c": "rationale · 6 records",
  "text.7b76a85a34a4182e558b": "The issuer reported Q2 2026 revenue of $191.9m and guided Q3 to $255–290m. A front-loaded growth path with a fast decline from 60% to 40%, 30% and 20% is a bounded analyst illustration of ramp then slowdown, not a forecast derived directly from units or guidance.",
  "text.127f4f9d61e789014561": "Management described approximate 200,000 monthly capacity and an expected 650,000 by year-end 2026. Capacity is not recognized revenue or guaranteed utilization; no direct multiplication of capacity by an invented selling price is used.",
  "text.972fbaed3460234cb640": "The initial margin is reported GAAP TTM EBIT/revenue. Conditional break-even by year 2 and 12% mature margin by year 6 are analyst operating-leverage judgments; non-GAAP net income is not substituted for GAAP EBIT.",
  "text.96b915f0730c09898c1b": "Initial 0.8x sales/capital remains a conservative capital-heavy input; the temporary twofold utilization improvement is assumed, motivated by already funded construction and equipment prepayments, not by a verified incremental asset-turnover ratio.",
  "text.bc02d7baf515fe9026e4": "Capital intensity subsequently converges to the independently specified mature marginal ROIC, allowing competitive erosion of the higher mid-ramp return and eliminating a mechanical terminal reinvestment jump.",
  "text.dac9d0e3567267dbb666": "All forecast growth, margin, capital-efficiency and risk values remain editable or sampled. The fixed weights describe transition shape, not independent reported facts or probabilities.",
  "text.a3d5c7a094859afa0fec": "default Output Interpretation",
  "text.755b8dff2dc6c7410ac2": "The shared staged default still has negative operating enterprise value and common residual; show both raw residual and limited-liability floor, plus funding needs. It does not price abandonment, future funding access, default, recovery or an option to change strategy.",
  "text.f71bbb13c1c4fb9f40ce": "obligation asset register",
