  "text.1bbb8ea8e956052063a4": "funding · 3 fields",
  "text.4eaa8c08b7a492328417": "Net investment is an analytical sales-to-capital schedule. Full gross capex, maintenance, D&A, leases and WC cash bridge is not supplied for every year.",
  "text.4c184ebab1ee588ff689": "operating Income · 9 fields",
  "text.050f8d4d7a929563c010": "assistant judgment / educational default",
  "text.8fcc6a6983a2fc6ff763": "A mature hardware franchise with recurring services: moderate expansion, durable margins and relatively light incremental capital needs.",
  "text.205e38fa34ef10ca5c60": "8% starts above FY2025 growth of 6.4% but below the latest 16% quarter. Services and replacement demand support growth; the installed base and hardware maturity argue for an immediate fade rather than extrapolating one strong quarter.",
  "text.b0b1f02a4eecdd06a542": "20% is a normalized blended cash-tax judgment above FY2025 accounting tax of 15.6%; one-off tax charges, geographic mix and minimum-tax changes make any single reported rate a weak long-run anchor.",
  "text.5b3c9ace45f0242d6c9c": "3.0x requires about $0.33 of net reinvestment for each extra $1 of revenue. Outsourced manufacturing and services justify lighter capital needs; this is not the inflated book return created by buybacks or a claim that working capital is free.",
  "text.eebed317f9bd6d847d24": "20% retains a brand/ecosystem advantage but materially reduces returns on new capital from the explicit-period margin/capital combination.",
  "text.a25912e68b0aa4f11ccf": "Fiscal Q3 2026 revenue was $109.4bn, up 16%; reported gross margin included approximately two percentage points of favorable tariff refunds.",
  "text.6982eb1e2db41d2efd90": "bridge Policy · 4 fields",
  "text.43100289640d4b79bc07": "unreviewed",
  "text.caed2174c9ae22bd8932": "Long-dated securities, leases and employee awards need a consistent enterprise-to-common-equity reconciliation; zero additional assets does not mean the securities are worthless.",
  "text.5cff7d04a44e1d2a8d01": "Consolidated linear growth does not separately forecast hardware units, prices or services.",
  "text.c1ca60ef23b7deca89ab": "iPhone replacement cycles, China demand, tariffs and memory/input costs",
  "text.e82e5fc37a70b1f893ef": "Services regulation and the cost of supporting AI features",
  "text.09a836ca50a7181776be": "provisional-simplified-operating-case",
  "text.1e77e6aee7638633b691": "An internally checked conditional model, not proof that business assumptions will be realized.",
  "text.c66d3f6a55c8b4d750b2": "accounting Basis",
