  "text.3074561fec3d993eb521": "Cash bridge starting point; reserve operating liquidity and bridge post-June uses before current-date value.",
  "text.c06a1f2442dee1c5148b": "requires_explicit_model_policy",
  "text.e6f173155c4523371c09": "debt_carrying",
  "text.8cd58100e1f177dd0203": "3,330 current +128,894 noncurrent; debt face/discount basis differs",
