  "text.2a049e1763dbc2c7ad89": "Private, illiquid, valuation marks and ownership restrictions",
  "text.0cb52fd4fa0224a051e4": "Nonoperating-asset scenarios separate from AWS FCFF; discount taxes/illiquidity/mark uncertainty.",
  "text.4ab4fc61599e762747fd": "Anthropic_convertible_notes_fair_value",
  "text.338cd9d1c17fb44935b9": "Level 3 convertible note value; ownership cap and IPO conversion/lockup",
  "text.8a637315e988586ee7ab": "Separate asset; not cash and not double count preferred. Stress equity marks and collection.",
  "text.49a901f06f70761793b5": "OpenAI_preferred_June",
  "text.ab812c4aeb6d5e7475a3": "Private equity, commercial collaboration, contingent economics",
  "text.54856e529e318a066192": "Separate asset scenarios, not operating revenue.",
  "text.e9dc3295a425fb6d430f": "OpenAI_subsequent_funding",
  "text.3c345333ce355012f057": "Paid after June 30 and before filing; exact payment date not stated",
  "text.e46ec9855f4ba56e912c": "For post-June bridge reduce cash and increase investment; do not add asset with no cash reduction.",
  "text.074ced8384bfde238094": "Anthropic_remaining_facility",
  "text.6d2d2b62fde8c12f7a30": "Draw availability tied to compute-delivery milestones; financing instruments issued on draw",
  "text.cf68a6246b9f3bf13707": "Stress future cash commitments; do not treat as current debt or guaranteed AWS cash receipts.",
  "text.30f862cc9152e1a9a27e": "equity_method_other_investments",
  "text.51ff55216f7597c52056": "Carrying value may not represent realizable value",
  "text.9a659fe49e56788af330": "Review as additional nonoperating assets, no automatic full-value uplift.",
  "text.443f002ce55876c3ca9c": "equity_warrants",
  "text.182ddee651e89a1423cd": "Level 2/3, conditional exercise rights",
  "text.7f82b5fd486de1abc68e": "Separate asset and exercise-cash scenario; avoid double counting investments.",
  "text.e42f35737b12074391d7": "Globalstar_pending_transaction",
  "text.1b9060b6cd062b6a3163": "Announced enterprise value including debt, not fixed final consideration. Election $90 cash or 0.3210 AMZNshare cappedat$90;cashfractionmax 40%;up to 110 m downward milestone adjustment;expected 2027 closing subjectapprovals/satellitemilestones.",
  "text.49937c0b3f1727b3b905": "Schedule cash/stock funding and acquired assets on conditional closing; no automatic full enterprise-value debt deduction. Apple equity redemption agreements need separate cash review.",
  "text.772bbd41e43bee640fc1": "other_nonmarketable_equity_residual",
  "text.2e6e54a08e985b0418d0": "Approximate residual 122,300-92,500-28,700; rounded inputs",
  "text.198631e5fc419752c475": "No false precision; other investments require review. Not incremental to 122,300 total.",
  "text.e04e7170adf036b17a4a": "SBC_and_unvested_awards",
  "text.edc4be341c034ff276c7": "Unrecognized compensation cost is future service expense, not same as option intrinsic liability",
  "text.450a428a1553c90af0ae": "Keep SBC in margins; model actual share issuance/dilution. Do not both deduct full compensation backlog and expense it.",
  "text.627f7f27ead6d8f0cb51": "energy_derivative_assets_liabilities",
  "text.b7249844c60e8d0b95c0": "705 assets less 133 liabilities; noncash marks fluctuate with energy prices",
  "text.115595547c9d3f826882": "Do not capitalize recurring mark gains as operating growth; classify once in operating or nonoperating treatment.",
  "text.475fbc0f1fe859865d19": "recognized_other_financing_obligations",
  "text.6d6eea76a0798d4023f4": "amount Is Approximate",
  "text.c1d4a2b4a68db05a202f": "current Exact",
  "text.b77ebc9130070d54c2da": "noncurrent Rounded",
  "text.2b694d79d753da13c6ad": "source publication date",
  "text.8bb7d9b9137fef692615": "source section",
  "text.4e9e21202a4bce9ad1cb": "Commitments table footnote1",
  "text.bb79095c7bd563bfa1ed": "Recognized fulfillment-network and data-center financing obligations; long-term disclosure rounded to8.9bn. Excludes interest and is distinct from finance-lease liabilities.",
  "text.b5ee24fe5c5295681743": "Financing-like claim subject to consistent operating asset/cashflow policy. Reconcile this approximately9.315bn separately from funded debt and finance leases; do not use the11.070bn undiscounted including-interest payment total as face debt. Do not deduct future funding deficits.",
  "text.bc4d55113bfa0515248c": "Verified disclosed obligation; bridge policy and post-June roll-forward required",
  "text.47e756b0610a2cb38df4": "accounting model requirements",
  "text.298b64f5b624e00ae04a": "accounting model requirements · 6 records",
  "text.2702eb422c97e0a16a22": "Forecast physical capex, depreciation, lease additions/payments, inventory and working capital separately in early years; revenue-change/sales-capital is a compressed proxy.",
  "text.0ffa2f939a46134c1542": "Keep SBC in operating costs; do not add it back without an explicit offset for equity issued to employees.",
  "text.504b28c3daf997bcdc0c": "Separate cash-flow tax benefits of accelerated depreciation from normalized accrual tax; no terminal tax holiday.",
  "text.d668086f79b0c132a8e3": "Do not capitalize unrealized equity gains or energy derivative gains as operating earnings.",
  "text.a3f5c738985313346b83": "Satisfy terminal identity: terminal sales/capital = ROIC / after-tax operating margin.",
  "text.e6f63dc48a12d5615427": "Uncommenced leases and purchase commitments are not automatically additional net debt if already included in cash-flow forecasts.",
