  "text.3a6054c0e5c3d4a610f0": "No refreshed October17 balance sheet; use June30 anchor or explicitly bridge subsequently disclosed financing/investment events.",
  "text.d6f017ad987a5e7ce200": "No independent fair-value appraisal of private equity, customer-credit exposures, pending acquisitions or derivatives.",
  "text.338c5f6464aadedf1d9d": "No credible terminal customer-concentration or AI pricing dataset; scenario stresses remain wide.",
