  "text.85d97ac0c0c9cba5b9cb": "tax caution",
  "text.849137d400b4896516ae": "Cash taxes include group-wide taxes/refunds, not a disclosed unlevered operating allocation. This is an exact arithmetic normalization proxy, with interest timing, nonoperating-tax attribution and other-assets allocation requiring a sensitivity, not an audited FCFF.",
