  "text.dc6483be90f89f6e6571": "combined non PPE DA and tax adjusted WC CF source",
  "text.a3123dacda6d5d229142": "Subtracting all 41,441 deferred-tax add-back while leaving tax settlements in WC over-normalizes tax. Do not treat all 75,200 cash-flow D&A as physical PPE depreciation.",
  "text.7293d44c860dfbaed44f": "capital and supplier financing",
