  "text.45cf44ff07c71dd0e289": "accrual net physical investment after PPE DA",
  "text.71f64233aca14cd14774": "supplier credit funding difference",
  "text.37806e80c15b91408f5e": "convention",
  "text.867e2b2224e388bb1a2c": "Preferred cash-capex forecast excludes capital-creditors movement from operating WC. Track accrued asset additions and capital-creditor balances separately for capacity and paydown stress. If supplier credit is instead debtlike, include accrued capex, show equal financing inflow, and apply one consistent opening-liability claim. Never add 29,267 to cash capex as an unfinanced current cash requirement.",
  "text.bf53681daedc22784570": "CY2026 to rolling year1",
  "text.65b6bd5c9743d4081984": "CY2026 to rolling year1 · 10 fields",
  "text.e4df8bc8b437bd2f8d30": "management CY2026 cash capex approx USDm",
  "text.162db8b2df5701233401": "Cash capex interpreted consistently with the company Q2 $53.1bn and H1 $96.3bn net-of-sales/incentives measures; guide is approximate, not a hard contractual floor.",
  "text.b9898d285889305b007f": "H1 reported net cash capex USDm",
  "text.419fc8bb7bce0f940da3": "implied H2 2026 USDm",
