  "text.8655597f6c0900f9e6b1": "gross cash capex conversion",
  "text.6324c73b87ec97bb42d5": "Add assumed ~$4bn annual asset sales/incentives: rolling year1 gross cash capex ~$238–278bn; do not compare gross and net unlabeled.",
