  "text.462257345ec527f7dfdf": "normalization basis · 9 fields",
  "text.d0e099b7fc9c15af4601": "reported asset lives",
  "text.0773f3af16c3319fa52f": "Buildings up to 40 years; servers/networking 5–6 years; heavy equipment 10–13; other equipment 3–10. Subset server life reduced 6 to5 effective2025; increased2025 D&A by~1,400.",
  "text.d65c2829449651402962": "reported PPE cohorts",
  "text.9d3324569169dc494650": "FY2025 gross server/networking172,492; construction-in-progress71,745; netPPE357,025. June2026 netPPE446,046. TTM PPE D&A49,741 and Q2 annualized55,476.",
  "text.e3224a8fe962c36295e7": "analyst DA year1 range USDm",
  "text.5ff0227ed258e43266b8": "analyst DA year1 range USDm · 2 records",
  "text.8c5cfaf69fd62cada7fb": "analyst DA year2 range USDm",
  "text.763c5e33ea793a0ec7f9": "analyst DA year2 range USDm · 2 records",
  "text.39f526cd2d554021d7de": "analyst DA year3 range USDm",
  "text.f0b955db0af5d4725195": "analyst DA year3 range USDm · 2 records",
  "text.0c4d01e81bb3d1fd0dc4": "reasoning",
  "text.3a08aadf3e92bccdf8de": "Existing assets plus recent buildout moving in service drive depreciation catch-up. Do not depreciate all new construction from day1 or keep D&A flat as capex surges. As a rough cohort check, 60% server additions over5.5years,30% facilities over25years,10% other over10years gives~13.1% annual depreciation on in-service additions; half-year convention and retirement/CIP schedules can support~65bn next-year D&A. Mix, lives and placement dates are analyst assumptions, not disclosed future mix.",
  "text.f5f76a56fe19114b8734": "management cycle statement",
  "text.485f7b21fe750ae38c28": "Management described data-center spending about2years before monetization, servers purchased months before use, server breakeven under3years and longer-lived facilities. This supports an eventual normalization scenario, not certainty of utilization or returns.",
  "text.a06d5d1da769c181578d": "non PPE reinvestment basis",
  "text.1609e57561c6d247aefa": "Historical combined non-PPE amortization plus tax-adjusted operating-asset/liability cash movements was a 3.9bn source; forecast0–15bn year1 uses to allow Cloud receivables, inventory/content and lease-payment timing, excluding capital creditors and financing investments.",
  "text.22d088aab0f31dda3dcf": "years after7",
  "text.32ee2a925b3f0178f991": "Fade temporary implied capital productivity toward existing terminal S:C0.98684, consistent with12%ROIC / (16%margin ×76%after-tax share). No lower terminal reinvestment/free-cash-flow windfall.",
  "text.2b5c109f05244e7dc63f": "capacity reuse",
  "text.6f098dbf003b07671edd": "capacity reuse · 9 fields",
  "text.921ae31a89107f838bbd": "analyst_investment_sensitivity_not_issuer_guidance_or_probability",
  "text.e5058c5d9af943b81550": "Lower cash spending after the current buildout, earlier placement in service and capacity reuse. Requires utilization and base growth to arrive; not management guidance.",
  "text.8c69e3845345e00b0fb6": "period end",
  "text.13703bc34e48d5cb2000": "implied sales to incremental capital",
