  "text.7218eca94863f7f75040": "analyst transition from year7 implied capital efficiency to existing year15 terminal identity; gross capex not separately forecast",
  "text.d077aa71d3e6164302b7": "funding starting liquidity USDm",
  "text.4d0e117a2c68305097ad": "funding liquidity definition",
  "text.39b0c2d982f1863127d7": "122,988cash/currentmarketables less4,687marketableequity; restricted2,714alreadyexcluded, so do not subtract it twice.",
  "text.dee5bcec02d45c43d9db": "central normalization",
  "text.e328ae1262e0307ffd2e": "central normalization · 9 fields",
  "text.f0e03f586c716d09e7c8": "Cash capex continues rising, while prior server cohorts and completed construction enter depreciation and utilization. Retains existing base revenue, EBIT, normalized tax, WACC and terminal ROIC only to isolate capital sensitivity.",
  "text.173cb5c6289a6a6cf658": "prolonged buildout",
  "text.ae47cf07bf033279958e": "prolonged buildout · 9 fields",
  "text.297d25edb12b202127d2": "More construction and memory-cost pressure, delayed utilization, cash capex remains above 20% of revenue for several years. Financing stress, not issuer commitment; holding EBIT unchanged makes this an investment-only sensitivity rather than a full downside.",
  "text.f430958dda0469c5be05": "Years1–7; for prolonged buildout this is a minimum because year7 cash flow is still negative, not a claimed lifetime peak.",
  "text.fbbddfc5b1478374a6bb": "employee award settlement check",
  "text.b711cf3ff5d30b501f29": "employee award settlement check · 11 fields",
  "text.4074902922d0f088f61b": "No separate award-tax/withholding cash line identified in reviewed FY2025 and H1/TTM2026 cash flow statements or Company Facts. This is not verified zero.",
  "text.68c727bf02ed0126a081": "H1 2026 RSU vested millions",
