  "text.4cc5386c0a9da9eee9a0": "H1 SBC less equity line USDm",
  "text.6e83e7e0546347ca8709": "Gross share increase approximates vested units, unlike substantial net-share withholding; APIC difference cannot be assumed to be cash withholding. Cash timing or aggregated other financing may remain.",
  "text.7c871f997cb550576efa": "liquidity sensitivity USDm per year",
