  "text.4a33eacd5fa65f2b2e28": "item",
  "text.d7d2078c0f192e4afb9e": "amount USDm",
  "text.a556fa3d681cf0ba5bd9": "OpenAI post-June funding",
  "text.4f43a63513d3a03f169b": "Disclosed paid after June30 and before filing",
  "text.78b95f02d8105647ee64": "Year1 liquidity use exactly once, with investment asset acquired. Not debt; do not add equity asset without cash decrease.",
  "text.31760257f660f75ef52b": "Anthropic remaining facility",
  "text.fb83de0175ab542197b3": "Conditional on compute delivery/milestones; remaining facility at June30",
  "text.d92fb8556615ec5b16df": "Separate strategic-investment funding stress; asset acquired on draw. Not netted against backlog; commercial cash receipts already modeled in operating revenue/collections.",
  "text.e0c0dfd034de0c598e17": "Unconditional purchase obligations",
  "text.9ec3d51f0892c195cb78": "Disclosed undiscounted commitments: H2 2026 23,452;CY2027 33,026;2028 9,326",
  "text.e1d606d1a3caea8ee195": "Includes energy/content/software/PPE; map into capex or operating costs once, not additional debt.",
  "text.487303b978a3cceef6b5": "Uncommenced leases",
  "text.d89eeefff63ebfc34e49": "Disclosed undiscounted: H2 2026 4,018;CY2027 11,732;2028 9,278",
  "text.712e62d0d5177ee6bd38": "Map commencement and rent/capex consistently; never deduct total and also include all future operating rent.",
  "text.1331557b5d43473fe730": "Existing long-term debt principal and interest",
  "text.37be9e4136d7cd4ae43c": "Undiscounted contractual payments including interest: H2 2026 2,361;CY2027 14,060;2028 17,087",
  "text.e0d500893c852743d42a": "Principal refinancing and interest cash schedule, not incremental220,309 debt on top of132,224 carrying debt.",
  "text.e82177fad89c9cb28624": "Recognized financing obligations",
  "text.21b8cba831a9eabeb7af": "Approximate415current+8,900noncurrent; separate from13,451finance leases",
  "text.1a2d9a82908f839edc9b": "Add consistently to claims review if financed assets remain in EBIT/capex; payment schedule already in financing cash flows. Existing proposal register appears to omit this line.",
  "text.4409ad52503bfb71282f": "Globalstar",
  "text.fb50ff2b6f560cd6d3d3": "Announced enterprise value, conditional expected2027closing; not final cash consideration",
  "text.f79d7bca32ef1b0fabfc": "Cash/stock elections, acquired debt and Apple redemption need distinct bridge; do not set10,900cash spend mechanically.",
  "text.6e82e1db634602960737": "Undrawn June credit facilities",
  "text.36dbdf21f14e74a685fd": "15,000revolver toNovember2028;5,000line expiresOctober2026 absent renewal",
  "text.2a30fe98359c920c0d74": "Not cash or perpetual capacity; reverify availability at actual forecastdate.",
  "text.a117e424796675bcedc7": "Delayed draw term loan",
  "text.ff78c8695feda918cdee": "UndrawnJune30; draw window endedSeptember30,2026",
  "text.e22840c99292da644c37": "Do not count as undrawn available onOctober17 without subsequent draw/renewal evidence. No unverified October funding uplift.",
  "text.03875a8a71fab94e35ef": "valuation and funding policy",
  "text.7e37ed44b906524ee32f": "valuation and funding policy · 8 records",
  "text.e8e4f472beb6d96fea82": "Discount operating FCFF to obtain operating enterprise value; negative FCFF already reduces EV. Never deduct the cumulative modeled deficit again as current debt.",
  "text.42f02cd303651715fd09": "Present current operating EV independently of cash, debt, finance leases, financing obligations, nonoperating investments and other claim adjustments.",
  "text.1f235402ad460bb1713c": "Cash funding bridge adds SBC as a noncash financing source only; its compensation cost remains in valuation FCFF. Do not then impose a second full future SBC value charge. Existing awards/share-count policy remains separate.",
  "text.fae2c463b821e61e3a0c": "Explicit finance-lease asset additions reduce economic FCFF; equal noncash financing supports the liquidity bridge. Principal payments consume cash but are not another operating FCFF deduction.",
  "text.fbb1b02384a76edcbab8": "Keep operating leases as rent in EBIT/OCF unless all EBIT, D&A, capital, capex and debt treatment are recast. Do not subtract96,320 operating lease debt without that recast.",
  "text.5e6947fa94893c5dc081": "New build-to-suit financing-obligation asset additions not separately disclosed must be checked against the PPE roll-forward. Add a0–3bn/year economic FCFF sensitivity only if incremental to reported cash capex; equal noncash financing offsets liquidity. Do not infer asset additions directly from liability changes.",
  "text.fc2d674bbf1fe733125d": "Capital-creditors timing, accelerated depreciation and customer investment funding are separate mechanisms. Do not call private equity marks deployable cash or treat backlog as funded orders.",
  "text.b98730d2f089525774d8": "An external-funding need is a conditional financing plan: test debt capacity, dilution, covenant/liquidity buffers and cash interest. It does not automatically invalidate operating EV, imply equity issuance, or create an extra debt deduction.",
  "text.2dbc0c4690f8b12e820c": "implementation recommendation",
  "text.4f5a27ea0e372c4e8462": "Recommend central_normalization as the researched base capital override for years1–7, rather than the initial S:C schedule; review before production. Implement explicit first5–7year cash capex, PPE depreciation, finance-lease additions and non-PPE operating reinvestment schedules. Keep current high-investment S:C path as a sensitivity, not binding disclosed funding. Add a separate cash runway/financing panel, preserve normalized-tax economic FCFF and temporary cash tax benefits, and reconcile the missing financing obligations. No production files changed.",
  "text.83959f123cd6334d8a01": "executable base capital override",
  "text.e01b46f3ca4b5e3affde": "executable base capital override · 7 fields",
  "text.66a127cd49e13abfccf4": "selected scenario",
  "text.fc9cff6fcd2ab246b2a6": "central_normalization",
  "text.dbfe937585b4147cb6f3": "recommendation",
  "text.f0bd9f62f34e148c0b9a": "Replace initial base reinvestment schedule with this explicit research capital overlay, subject to implementation review; do not automatically write production defaults.",
  "text.4cfbe15aeb2a94d54758": "rows · 15 records",
  "text.ed347b530f67304511c6": "economic formula",
  "text.6d5d2c8fedce3a896601": "NOPAT - (gross cash capex - asset-sale proceeds/incentives + finance-lease additions - PPE D&A + non-PPE operating reinvestment)",
  "text.fa2f20a097fe4b5964e2": "cash formula",
  "text.ae8fc2c0e6b68b1c9318": "economic FCFF + gross SBC - award cash settlements + cash-tax benefit + noncash finance-lease funding - net cash interest - lease/financing-obligation principal",
  "text.af99b8d7fc028ff505b9": "later normalization",
  "text.50bc43751f894e95d97e": "Years8–15 linearly fade year7 implied incremental S:C to original terminal0.98684; retain original revenue/EBIT/tax/WACC/terminal growth/ROIC.",
  "text.3d38ee92463c404a4c5d": "residual gates",
  "text.eb6722f78396bd13cc2e": "residual gates · 5 records",
