  "text.a3d4c40a230018b83b64": "Reported long-term debt only; short-term and lease completeness must be reviewed before valuation.",
  "text.6bcbc6b831fda0f0e9ce": "AWS, advertising and fulfillment efficiency raise consolidated profitability, with a heavy infrastructure bill and lower-margin retail still central.",
  "text.624e7259e72ea27c2f3a": "14% sits between FY2025 growth of 12.4% and Q2 2026 growth of 20%. AWS and advertising support expansion, but they cannot justify applying their segment growth to all retail revenue.",
  "text.80d95f70c7165ef1287d": "15% improves on 12.1% TTM as AWS/advertising mix and retail efficiency rise. It remains far below AWS segment margins because consolidated sales include substantial low-margin commerce.",
  "text.8bfddf9084cd1879fd3c": "24% is a normalized operating-tax assumption. Recent investment gains distort pretax income and the accounting effective rate, so those gains do not set operating cash tax.",
  "text.1b59826a28c5cc96ee90": "0.8x requires $1.25 of net reinvestment per incremental $1 of sales. AI data centers, fulfillment and working capital keep reinvestment high even with supplier financing; early modeled FCFF can be negative.",
  "text.244eb853ff3560200cdb": "10% assumes mature capital earns approximately the cost of capital. Scale advantages are largely competed away after the explicit growth period.",
  "text.6a9f029dd0fdc051f59c": "10.0% nominal USD is a rounded model estimate. Assumed beta 1.2, 10% target debt and a 1-point debt spread balance resilient diversified businesses against discretionary spending and the infrastructure funding cycle.",
  "text.ae1dbc3b7d78be8fd334": "0 is an unreviewed placeholder, not evidence that no additional claims exist. Review operating/finance leases, financing obligations and minority investments. Current cash is not a complete appraisal of all non-operating assets.",
  "text.c64e83fd51254ac04be7": "AMZN-filing",
  "text.faa0841da6cb2b7bc9c4": "Q2 revenue grew 20%, AWS revenue grew 37%, and TTM free cash flow was an outflow of $7.6bn. The release separately identified non-operating investment gains.",
  "text.08fa1ee8785bb3a3e4d8": "AMZN-release",
  "text.25dc46467a806508054f": "AMZN-annual-filing",
  "text.0b5f89b33093b1823641": "Review operating/finance leases, financing obligations and minority investments. Current cash is not a complete appraisal of all non-operating assets.",
  "text.dc78d17b41d4fb02f8cd": "About 93% of modeled operating value comes after year 10. The result is highly dependent on mature margins, required reinvestment and discount rates.",
  "text.7908eadc12bd0abe0e2f": "A single margin hides very different AWS, advertising and retail economics; net reinvestment is not the company free-cash-flow reconciliation.",
  "text.c8f49e7a2a9e7e22624f": "AWS capacity economics and depreciation versus AI demand",
  "text.7a8e9c75461d1e76d806": "Retail wage, shipping and competitive pressures; investment gains are not operating earnings",
  "text.0dabef6e889a1bfccf7e": "7549fb68446eee40e1f50a166fa06b2d2ee6349e07c8553a4828757e032d3cd4",
  "text.ccbc65a5abdb84c7ab0b": "us-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesMinorityInterestAndIncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments",
  "text.594e1aa81569cf007ab1": "us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets",
  "text.3dd14cfb1ffc64669e6e": "research And Development · 2 fields",
