  "text.711e8193be5c9d6bf1f4": "short Term Borrowings · 12 fields",
  "text.5d9d8ab660bbb0616c0b": "Retail, AWS and advertising have different margins and capital needs. Leases and the timing of fulfillment/data-center investment matter.",
