  "text.f95b9575229da5f60184": "event date: 2026-06-23",
  "text.123be7e598d34a608d4e": "issuer_interview_excerpt",
  "text.2463308b1a13254b5cf1": "Exact issuer article date not visible; do not invent one.",
  "text.3c977beb2cc9642efce8": "Matt Garman issuer biography",
  "text.4290cca2561d8ed00e92": "AMZN-Garman-tenure",
  "text.01b790f61920287789cf": "issuer_biography",
  "text.3316348dbadfb7b11c7c": "read",
  "text.ab9392cdc375f7e17915": "AWS CEO since June 2024; exact effective date June 3 in issuer leadership announcement.",
  "text.7f91a084030936eaffc0": "EBITMargin",
  "text.66c9d266f259a2e22da0": "source Ids · 3 records",
  "text.5e8677960d8607ae7c67": "Selected S:C 2 and tax 20% retained. Capital rule is provisional; verified gross capex, depreciation, WC, commitment and funding schedules are unavailable.",
  "text.5e9b77a6997413a2b7d7": "Final explicit S:C remains 2. Terminal ROIC policy changes investment intensity; disclosed FCFF transition is not silently smoothed.",
  "text.85ee56842b5b7f030ced": "The July 2022 Coherent acquisition changed scale and capital structure. FY2017–FY2022 describe legacy II-VI and are visible as predecessor context, but excluded from current-business summary ranges. Acquisition amortization and impairments affect comparability. FY2024–2026 EBIT is a derived subtotal using the latest statements, identified in evidence.",
  "text.18917591894a9a3168a2": "Future fiscal year-end dates may shift; labels do not assert unannounced exact fiscal calendars.",
  "text.0572156c199a0f4fe1fb": "Optical datacenter demand and integration benefits lift profitability, balanced against manufacturing investment and a mixed industrial portfolio.",
  "text.1a1a79c1da6063b7e3ac": "20% improves on FY2026 GAAP EBIT margin of 12.6% through utilization, mix and integration. It is an EBIT assumption after ongoing compensation and depreciation, not a non-GAAP gross-margin target.",
  "text.0007c3e55c2e2f91091d": "24% normalizes the very low FY2026 effective rate and prior loss-related volatility; acquisition and restructuring tax effects are not extended indefinitely.",
  "text.28aa4be2c2fc146a76d8": "1.25x implies $0.80 of net investment for each incremental $1 of sales. Vertical manufacturing, capacity and working capital remain important even if acquired capacity improves utilization.",
  "text.774ddfd96e9b52681498": "12% assumes moderate enduring photonics know-how benefits but much less than current high-growth incremental economics.",
  "text.68dc3b7c061a440a2037": "Fiscal Q4 2026 revenue was $2.05bn, up 34% reported and 42% pro forma, with 38.5% GAAP gross margin.",
  "text.35196aa04591a24dc72d": "Review preferred securities, minority interests and debt terms; acquisition accounting and claims cannot be inferred from a historical book-capital ratio.",
  "text.dd9ac6a6d00984b942d9": "About 80% of modeled operating value comes after year 10. The result is highly dependent on mature margins, required reinvestment and discount rates.",
  "text.9ab7aadd4944b85a413f": "The 2022 Coherent acquisition is a structural break; predecessor II-VI decade averages are not a clean forecast for today’s perimeter.",
  "text.c9df9bd72cb9b6bd829b": "Optical design wins, yields, pricing and capacity ramps",
  "text.22d8907032b8392beb9e": "Integration, divestitures, debt and minority/preferred interests",
