  "text.ee207a40fb5017ba9288": "Capex rises materially from original budgets as delivery/demand changes. FY2025 actual was 21.93% above initial ~$75bn and inside final $91–93bn range. This supports capacity-demand visibility but warns against fixed reinvestment forecasts. No revenue forecasting hit-rate or CEO score can be inferred.",
