  "text.97be0c9acd5ef1c12436": "Product launches and unquantified efficiency ambitions not folded into financial scoring.",
  "text.3b2813d30c14b5d66298": "Capex approximate points have no invented tolerance band.",
  "text.0a610b09afbfd04895f9": "Observed demand is strong; numerical quarterly total-revenue guidance is absent.",
  "text.451b48d9314d90390c0b": "High for reported facts and disclosure policy; medium for visibility.",
  "text.fcf61d91c93492c1a2fe": "Cloud revenue 24.768 bn grew 82%; Cloud backlog was 513.9 bn.",
  "text.1ecb407771047b3053b9": "Kurian described larger deals and broader AI adoption.",
  "text.559bd158acdb1dd0ae6f": "GOOG-Kurian-20260908",
  "text.d20734952e48ff159d0d": "Delivery, utilization and hardware mix affect backlog conversion.",
  "text.70bc33a597a8bf3ad786": "No revenue hit-rate can be derived from capex guidance or sell-side estimates.",
  "text.9b2bb29decc6cce8c8dd": "Pichai, Kurian, commercial leadership and finance share responsibility; the CFO changed in 2024.",
  "text.cd2bc90bb58ed2e7b894": "Broad AI rollout and TPU monetization are evidenced; hardware/service economics are distinct.",
  "text.dd6ce8370b9e602494a3": "TPU systems began reaching customer data centers inQ2; most existing-agreement revenue was expected in 2027.",
  "text.4efc2143f16b935b8b6f": "Kurian explained cloud consumption, hardware sales and infrastructure-provider TPU routes.",
  "text.c3c6c9014ec2ade4ed83": "Customer ROI and benchmark claims are not independently verified here.",
  "text.56a572db6c8b36e25d75": "Inventory, returns and delivery timing make hardware revenue less recurring.",
  "text.b0a830d880dfae261472": "Kurian leads Cloud commercial execution; Pichai, DeepMind and product teams shape broader AI delivery.",
  "text.068af96a8fcc53acdf6b": "Rapid expansion with recurring supply gaps and changing budgets.",
  "text.6bf7dea8159c81f2b71c": "FY2026 capex guidance reached 195–205 bn, from 175–185 bn inFebruary; third-party capacity would bridge supply gaps.",
  "text.40a450912ebb150a0b50": "H1 capex 80.598 bn, net PPE 321.212 bn and uncommenced leases 85.2 bn show the scale of commitments.",
  "text.ed11d2adf475c69a230d": "Intersect and accelerated delivery change spending comparisons.",
  "text.181ad9068641614df5c6": "Third-party capacity and depreciation can pressure margins.",
  "text.0951e20689d8e4039437": "Anat Ashkenazi has led finance sinceJuly 31,2024; capacity execution spans Pichai, Kurian and infrastructure teams.",
  "text.1878957c743177fc6935": "Reported margin expansion despite investment; central costs and future depreciation matter.",
  "text.649c95fdd4fcc4529b21": "High for reported trend; medium for durability.",
  "text.753c27124e7025210821": "FY2024 GAAP operating margin 32.11% exceeded FY2023 at 27.42%, meeting the directional outlook.",
  "text.00729dfdf8dda2f74b61": "Q2 Cloud EBIT8.814 bn sits alongside 5.789 bn of Alphabet-level losses, largely shared AI work.",
  "text.dccae9c14b4163239a1e": "Cloud segment margin is not a fully loaded standalone AI return.",
  "text.4056d0084208e66c2e8e": "SBC, power and depreciation remain genuine costs.",
  "text.e05320de3418dcac16d8": "Ruth Porat led finance throughQ22024; Ashkenazi thereafter. Pichai and segment teams span both periods.",
  "text.57ca2c3587c49f18865e": "Historical profitable products do not yet establish returns on the enlarged AI capital program.",
  "text.ad093a35c8774976c928": "Medium-low for forward returns.",
  "text.1ca151f202c40b97a1bc": "Capex 91.447 bn was 21.93% above the original approximate 75 bn and inside the final 91–93 bn range.",
  "text.e5b61bb48c523888f255": "H1 FCF4.261 bn, new common/preferred issuance and zero H1 buybacks mark a changed financing regime.",
  "text.db7a58f2bdb8a77ffa2f": "Unrealized investment gains inflate earnings without operating cash.",
  "text.921ccb086eccc7337f45": "Preferred conversion, backstops and private equity need explicit common-owner claim modeling.",
