  "text.c1fe05544ed5b8364d46": "The latest CY2026 gross cash capex guide is 195,000–205,000. The rolling year ending June2027 includes the higher 2027 spend profile, so 196,181 of net reinvestment is plausible; neither an error nor proof of financing distress can be inferred from comparison with the calendar guide.",
