  "text.5d7f15d9f47fcbf9d7c8": "Q4 EPS also benefited from nonoperating investment gains; retirement expense below guide and gaming charges complicate cost comparisons.",
  "text.fc884d08774576375967": "Fade margins conservatively and keep lease/depreciation/cash accounting consistent; no efficiency credit for reclassification.",
  "text.19184b0654ebd0e11c67": "Strong cash generation funds growth and distributions, but AI investment returns remain unproven at full-cycle scale.",
  "text.758e7e3f2ce1dc0b42b9": "CFO182.935bn, cashcapex115.948bn; program repurchases16.719bn and dividendsdeclared27.035bn.",
  "text.41a70f17d090fe6fe4fa": "Nadella explains utilization, hardware generations and diverse applications as return drivers.",
  "text.1597c7887f3e7a8e0bda": "Lease/prepayment commitments make simple cashcapex FCF incomplete.",
  "text.901cc74b6074b985dfbf": "OpenAI revenue24.1bn andAR6bn create distinct counterparty exposure alongside equity investment.",
  "text.1d91801341ef145325ea": "IRS28.9bn demand remains disputed; current reserves must be reconciled.",
  "text.2c61649ee1dae2ea6d70": "Do not assume old software capital intensity; base terminal marginalROIC16% is a scenario, not demonstrated AI-project return.",
  "text.8b4203132110d2348475": "annual Schedule · 20 records",
  "text.515fa2ebbe324af401bd": "source Links · 3 records",
  "text.66c5c107d1e9ff75bf35": "claims · 27 fields",
  "text.93c51fdedf7722c19058": "Base18/17/15/13/11% balances FY26+17.8%, next-quarter16–17% total guide, Azure45% CC guide and broad RPO growth excluding OpenAI25%. It does not extrapolate totalRPO84% or Azure43% to the consolidated company. Bull20-year scale is deliberately demanding and must be tested against customer IT spending.",
  "text.a8ad476cf8fcc154e562": "FY27 guide down<1pp anchors46% first-year versus46.78% FY26. Fade toward43% prices in lower-margin infrastructure/consumption mix and faster economic obsolescence; bull46% needs applications and efficiency offset; bear36% tests pricing/utilization failures.",
  "text.fcfb8ec5f91492b06826": "Base0.45x first-year incremental sales/capital charges approximately$133bn reinvestment, then improves. FY26 cash+finance-lease additions less cash-flow D&A/other already imply~0.49x before working capital. Long-run0.85x requires substantial utilization and efficiency gains. CY2026 capex175bn is classification-sensitive, not an investment cut.",
  "text.5b16d6cdf5b821bb6b2c": "22% normalized cash-tax estimate above FY27 quarterly20% guide, with investment gains/deferred taxes excluded from operating earnings logic.",
  "text.be6e269bbdf53943d917": "Base16% marginal ROIC,15-year maturity;20-year bull22% ROIC requires durable software/application capture. Bear11% at10years leaves little spread over10.5% WACC. Final capital ratio is explicitly reconciled to terminal ROIC.",
  "text.ea501746db6ad42e9284": "Lease liabilities66.594bn finance and21.925bn operating plus329.1bn uncommenced commitments require economic cash-flow treatment; do not capitalize all and also charge all lease rent. Review36.348bn investments separately; do not project fair-value gains into EBIT.",
  "text.37b8668dee992e11596c": "Azure growth slows materially despite new capacity becoming available, weakening scarcity/utilization thesis",
  "text.096349c0a02535bddd32": "RPO conversion slows, cancellation/credit terms worsen or frontier-lab concentration rises",
  "text.4650df06e1c98373f20e": "Reported capex declines because of reclassification while cash lease burden/prepayments continue rising",
  "text.386f7ea55e462616ce3c": "Cloud margin and cash generation fall beyond FY27 outlook without monetization improvement",
  "text.496b83865e1b8a7c2f65": "Copilot paid usage rises faster than usage pricing or customer retention fails to support economic cost",
  "text.091120e0f6e2cecce918": "Hardware replacement needs or impairment undermine six-year server accounting life and long-lived infrastructure utilization",
  "text.1747d0d8de90082bbaca": "reportedSnapshots[id=MSFT-CURRENT-2026-06-30].facts",
