  "text.be4e6df5af30cddc5286": "EMS and per-user Power BI shift Azure/M365 metric boundaries. Q1 total revenue outlook unchanged; revised Azure CC growth about 33%, replacing non-comparable 28–29% old definition.",
  "text.38d9a50a195b7a5ffa3c": "Satya Nadella at Morgan Stanley TMT",
