  "text.dec2a10271ec0377c4f3": "primary issuer-hosted conference interview transcript",
  "text.7141efc412f46fdd4550": "Management links AI returns to utilization, multi-generation hardware economics, diverse applications and subscriptions plus metered consumption. Upstream components and power constrain buildout; strategic explanation is not a numerical return guarantee.",
  "text.85d95ea957d3bd95e158": "MSFT-macro-riskFree",
  "text.2dd9dd3a365d22fb4b90": "MSFT-macro-equityRiskPremium",
  "text.da55aa6660ccb6551a17": "FY2026 includes 53 weeks; annual model is not a quarter-by-quarter 52/53-week bridge.",
  "text.e3196695759f4746a2c7": "Negative-growth years still incur direct fab investment. No nonnegative revenue-growth/S:C adapter can represent these rows.",
  "text.5b81b5e137d93acfd38a": "Customer deposit repayments, grants and dilution require separate consistent claim/forecast treatment.",
  "text.6e78a0ea8b3e18477a5a": "Final explicit revenue growth is 2.5% versus terminal growth 2.0%; preserve the published path and disclose this endpoint change alongside the capital convention transition.",
  "text.6df396f042e2b28c8556": "Comparable FY2023 current-Nebius-perimeter balance not established. Old Yandex group balances deliberately excluded.",
  "text.e735a75791009d8f7297": "Not mapped from this issuer’s historical evidence; not assumed zero.",
  "text.ea5000abb8a578d58c30": "FY2025 pretax profit USD13.8m includes USD598.9m investment-revaluation gain. Its reported 28.99% ETR does not establish an operating tax norm.",
  "text.8382e2f6d6cb6ca3a1b4": "Never concatenate old unrecast Yandex financials into this series.",
  "text.340757929761faa7f5b4": "Gross new advances and revenue recognition after 2029 are not separately projected; net movement follows an explicit 25%-of-revenue balance policy.",
  "text.e9a074b40b9c90499903": "Cash funding excludes financing, interest, principal, reserves and employee award withholding; customer advance availability is a scenario assumption.",
  "text.836f1259ea09215529f2": "Provisional research assumptions only. A directional AI-cloud operating hypothesis only: growth, funding, depreciation and post-financing equity claims need a specialist model.",
  "text.d15661c9f2cba9f3ebaa": "0.6x means $1.67 of incremental net capital per added $1 of revenue. Hardware/data centers are capital-heavy; this normalized ratio is far less demanding than today’s front-loaded spend and cannot finance the actual ramp.",
  "text.09e6e6f5cba9c91af975": "12% assumes competitive mature infrastructure returns below the constant 15.5% model WACC. A credible model would separately fade risk and capital intensity as the company matures.",
  "text.476fbbcb36ff91103e99": "Q2 group revenue was $582.3m, up 454%; AI-cloud ARR was $3.0bn. Q2 capex was approximately $5.7bn. ARR is last-month revenue annualized, not recognized annual revenue.",
  "text.f6a341bd3fa5d6679322": "Preserve the existing hard gate: August financing and share exchanges supersede the June balance sheet; post-financing cash, debt, exact shares and equity-linked claims must be reconciled.",
  "text.fd6f38a419cd09427afe": "This exact linear-path assumption set produces negative operating enterprise value. It is an operating stress hypothesis, not a credible standalone fair-value estimate.",
  "text.f0402e73ee007bbcf04f": "Valuation remains withheld. Linear margin recovery from TTM losses, a constant discount rate and growth-only reinvestment cannot represent the announced ramp, funding or GPU replacement cycle.",
  "text.8f967a2ca5522525591d": "Old Yandex-group history is not comparable with the post-divestment AI-cloud business.",
  "text.4f4282387d355886c445": "Power/capacity delivery, utilization, GPU pricing and economic useful lives",
  "text.0e0683cf7b8acc21a627": "Convertible financing, warrants, subsidiary claims and future dilution",
