  "text.cca60dc3f55277bdd153": "Supply agreements can sometimes be cancelled/rescheduled/adjusted before firm orders; changes may have costs. Gross commitments are not automatically debt.",
  "text.e545b2da60f64b10e104": "Land/power/shell guarantees arise on partner default and decline over5–7years with partner payments; escrow reduces exposure but is not freely available NVIDIA cash.",
  "text.a7fe363c59bd64b5e651": "Aug10 >$500bn financing initiative is third-party capital target under MOUs; not NVIDIA cash, debt, backlog or booked revenue. Any support is project-specific.",
  "text.ab0ae74334d089b9f265": "SBC remains an operating expense; do not add back future SBC and also ignore dilution. Unrecognized compensation is not the fair value of outstanding awards.",
  "text.156ad28d530a83636e53": "Strategic equity carrying values include unrealized gains and require liquidity/valuation/tax review before adding to operating value.",
  "text.36dcaf7f55e1031be71a": "Separate additional36bn AI-cloud agreements are reduced by customer or NVIDIA capacity use; cloud partners can discontinue provision to NVIDIA and sell to third parties, with conditional revenue sharing. Do not confuse these with29bn own-R&D cloud agreements.",
  "text.b8143eda2823bde756d7": "Additional20bn uncommenced leases intended for reassignment to third parties are separate from25bn own-use uncommenced leases. Expected commencementFY2028–29, roughly15-year terms; intended reassignment is not completed transfer of obligations.",
  "text.4a6c2215c7ee3cf96e0c": "August105bn SB Energy/OpenAI guarantee cap is post-balance-sheet but disclosed before cutoff. Nine phases, first expectedFY2029; tenant-default trigger, covered portions of20-year lease/power payments, exposure declines; terminates on specified credit-rating events or lease expiry. Option to support another3.8GW is discretionary, not committed cap.",
  "text.fca2bebbd862dd3235d5": "Do not double-count gross obligations against already modeled operating expenditures, working capital or recognized liabilities. Claims valuation needs default probability, phase timing, coverage, recovery, discounting and correlation with operating downside.",
  "text.843636cc26978e45eafc": "986m Groq license consideration remains accrued; classify consistently with operating working capital or financing bridge, never both.",
