  "text.f078409fd554cb6b6a93": "GAAPGross Margin Counts · 3 fields",
  "text.8289b3b59c4063fb77cf": "Ten revenue outcomes exceeded original upper bounds. This supports conservative short-horizon guidance in this demand regime, but demonstrates positive bias rather than exact unbiased forecasting. One major margin miss due to export controls cautions against broad credibility transfer.",
