  "text.69a84103c7101e1a2d71": "Q4FY27 71–72%; FY28 72–73%",
  "text.2bda6f49a5b6bf12cf01": "Memory costs exceeded prior expectations",
  "text.1ffc3cd7890fc7ffc2cc": "old Comparable Numerical Full Year Range",
  "text.d830f227922318be3473": "Do not invent original full-year range",
  "text.f0b90c40d7f556938ee1": "aspirational Statements · 1 records",
  "text.3fb3627a51e6eba3d576": "NVDA-GS-interview",
  "text.1715d209be010efa8a4b": "Physical-AI robotics/edge expansion over roughly2–5years; investment-backed compute thesis",
  "text.0feebf7391c0a1040343": "Qualitative/timing statements, not comparable to formal quarterly revenue guidance",
  "text.35cea749856fbaf85109": "Jensen Huang CEO throughout sample; Colette Kress CFO throughout. Evidence is company/team execution, not a causal CEO score.",
  "text.26f4df34dd1d69fc6a85": "Conservative formal revenue guidance in AI ramp",
  "text.5d91cc2bca9ae486ec2d": "high for observed10quarter series; low for transfer beyond horizon",
  "text.ea418a2e9ab71d015af1": "10/10 revenues above original upper range; see matched ledger",
  "text.a087ef90b5316d53fc3f": "FY28+70% is unseasoned",
  "text.6140e0ad929c4eda2306": "GAAP gross margin FY26Q1 missed70.6% center by10.1points after export restrictions",
  "text.66011ba235a0b549fa3d": "Rapid platform monetization with complex roadmap risk",
  "text.12498e8409b8e01ccc0a": "Q1FY27 call expected Rubin production shipments inQ3; Aug26 call reports August commencement",
  "text.b3cae0c815fec1dcf4ad": "Blackwell-led DataCenter revenue89.0bn latest quarter",
  "text.04a9c7f7bbbd0bc8ccd5": "Product-specific shipment revenue not independently audited; rapid transitions create yield/inventory risk",
  "text.312a973b0332da6cfeba": "NVDA-Q1FY27-call",
  "text.52ad1dd22e9e7962ed8f": "Scale and supplier access demonstrated; new commitments increase downside",
  "text.beb77a71d4340bbee756": "Supply/capacity commitments279bn versus119bn previous quarter",
  "text.f1228f6600b7002433be": "Revenue doubledYoY",
  "text.69fe2acb1cd13bd4f955": "Supply constrainedFY28 outlook; rising memory prices force margin reset",
  "text.988fad0909dde36c151b": "High operating leverage, but not immunity to input costs",
  "text.8462b8530bdc40d3da9e": "Q2GAAP operating margin66.2%",
  "text.34a476e75797a4152311": "SBC included inFY27 nonGAAP metrics improves comparability",
  "text.408ea2ccac9b042d0b6f": "Q4FY27 gross margin expected71–72%, below current75%; future not yet realized",
  "text.00fc3f3609e09dbc655c": "6M AR and inventory cash absorption34.794bn",
  "text.c72196eb1fe95e7a39c9": "Strategic ecosystem expansion with material correlated-credit risk",
  "text.54754e3d830188c79aab": "low-moderate until investments mature",
  "text.de59a1084da7e3778f85": "6M equity purchases42.404bn; debt issuance24.896bn",
  "text.630fa5ac94fc075b618f": "Independent-financing MOU >500bn third-party target",
  "text.5551c2e0e6ab801e5d14": "Strategic investments and support may correlate with product demand; unrealized equity gains do not prove cash returns",
  "text.b0eea7e8141d1c77f655": "Guarantees/leases/commitments require scenario valuation",
  "text.b294c0f62c70503ff5ff": "105bn post-quarter SB Energy/OpenAI guarantee and56bn additional cloud/third-party-lease commitments materially expand contingent exposure; long-term returns unseasoned.",
  "text.65c11ea7e71255446045": "Change confidence, scenario weights only with an explicit justified probabilistic framework, and forecast uncertainty by metric/horizon; no automatic valuation multiplier or generic CEO score.",
  "text.33e6f0ae4c84d79ee34e": "Analytical proposals for review only; no app edited; no stock-price calibration",
  "text.e89d2cbeb3e909fc0a58": "Model years are rolling12month periods after2026-07-26, not named fiscal years. Fiscal guidance is a cross-check; a quarterly bridge is needed before implementing calendar/fiscal forecasts.",
  "text.690683f3878fa9ebd4f2": "The old40% next-TTM assumption is difficult to reconcile with Q3$108bn and management preliminaryFY28+70%.80/45/25% staged next-TTM growth recognizes an elevated ramp while fading much faster after year3; it is not a direct70% transcription. Near-term fiscal reference: H1FY27 actual177.837bn + Q3guide108bn + analyticalQ4 120bn impliesFY27~405.837bn; management70% FY28 would imply~689.9bn. A nextTTM of545.346bn lies between those fiscal totals and remains conditional.",
  "text.6a5cba052b62ddeb7f37": "early Horizon",
  "text.4060d8c7c6484153c0e7": "3 years capture current Blackwell/Rubin ramp and a subsequent adoption window; ten-year total is preferred to15/20 because visibility beyond the current platform/customer-capex cycle is weak. Bull15-year persistence tests a sustained platform, not higher certainty.",
  "text.dfc306a52e2cdf3d4da8": "Explicit annual operating margin should be62/59/56% in years1–3 then fade to45% byyear10, reflecting memory gross-margin guidance72–73%, compute/R&D cost, and scarcity normalization. GAAP margin afterSBC/DA; investment gains excluded.",
  "text.33ae03dcdaa76ba69410": "2x incremental sales/net reinvestment is a forward judgment. Cash-flow AR/inventory growth and project support mean fabless does not imply capital-free; separate long-lived strategic investment and guarantee analysis is required.",
  "text.fb4bc65e33109ade6588": "20% normalized versus16–18% FY27 management outlook; all model tax rates are operating assumptions.",
  "text.221617318bcf512885af": "discount",
  "text.9c7a3e1344428951dadd": "11% nominalUSD retained as a rounded risk judgment, not a live regression; test10–13%. Do not lower it mechanically because management beat near-term guidance.",
  "text.fea15336d827c1de5ec1": "2.5% nominal growth and25% terminalROIC preserve a substantial moat but force reinvestment10% of terminalNOPAT. No terminal ROIC equals historical book proxy.",
  "text.591b940c483da2e2aaa5": "Keep bridge gated. Review debt, leases, awards, strategic equity, financing guarantees and post-quarter arrangements; null additional claims/assets means unresolved, not zero.",
  "text.7389987d09870abbfcbc": "guidance Use",
  "text.c2ab4aa96f07a375e05d": "Strong10-quarter record permits giving the stated near-term ramp substantial evidentiary weight. It does not justify a CEO premium, indefinite growth or blind acceptance of unseasonedFY28 forecasts.",
  "text.e8e5981589765c3de068": "economic Warning",
  "text.d23d11de7d19d27db44c": "Reported terminal-scale consequences are constraints to debate; base requires multi-trillion annual revenue. Enterprise/physicalAI and broader full-stack content must expand materially to support it.",
  "text.dd4a62cf9b5c2758a030": "unresolved Gates · 5 records",
