  "text.c2029f0b91e546903da1": "Existing employee-award value is unquantified; current common allocation does not assert fully diluted fair value.",
  "text.d5890cf82aedcb8680a4": "Conditional Globalstar redemption proceeds are unquantified and receive no incremental asset credit.",
  "text.c01f87dabb0f3bac113d": "84,118 of noncurrent securities is added once, outside the snapshot cash of 62,399.",
  "text.f78ab75bf7523c4c70c7": "Debt uses exact 11,007 + 71,340 term debt + 1,997 commercial paper, not the rounded debt note.",
  "text.716d30f8e9dcd627034e": "Source-dated conditional capital allocation; retrospective October 17 research, not information knowable at the capital date",
