  "text.500d941830c9d8ff935b": "Cash and equivalents plus mapped current marketable debt securities/short-term investments only. Noncurrent marketable securities and equity securities are disclosed separately and are not silently included in this provisional bridge. Provisional debt base: current plus noncurrent carrying amounts where available; Apple commercial paper added; other short-term tags NOT automatically added because they may overlap. Micron includes finance leases. Review separate debt, lease and equity-claim components before valuation. Actual cover-date common shares, all common classes where applicable; existing awards require separate claims treatment; dated 2026-07-17.",
  "text.1dd35d6dcaaf51092758": "Cash and equivalents plus mapped current marketable debt securities/short-term investments only. Noncurrent marketable securities and equity securities are disclosed separately and are not silently included in this provisional bridge. Provisional debt base: current plus noncurrent carrying amounts where available; Apple commercial paper added; other short-term tags NOT automatically added because they may overlap. Micron includes finance leases. Review separate debt, lease and equity-claim components before valuation. Actual cover-date common shares, all common classes where applicable; existing awards require separate claims treatment; dated 2026-08-03.",
  "text.6a4020f182ae714e9175": "Cash and mapped marketables already include $87,063m of marketable equity, including $80,000m of restricted equity. Noncurrent investments are a separate carrying-value proxy, not a fair-value appraisal.",
  "text.9d35704d687f29cf9af9": "Compare your growth story with the company’s actual annual expansion and contractions. Annual history is IASB IFRS in TWD; it is not interchangeable with the current TIFRS TTM series.",
  "text.9f9efa571cc6832701c7": "Compare your growth story with the company’s actual annual expansion and contractions. This series is FY2025-recast continuing operations; old Yandex group totals are excluded.",
  "text.85a77ba0775a0284b2b7": "Convertible debt, pre-funded warrants, employee awards and subsidiary SAFE claims require consistent dilution/debt treatment. Do not count convertible debt and if-converted shares simultaneously.",
  "text.85d268fd8595a2538775": "Dated convertible fair value, separate vendor financing, and an explicitly approximate customer-warrant claim.",
  "text.a3b51e9206393e8426ce": "Existing employee awards, financing needs and future share issuance remain unmodeled. GAAP operating compensation stays in EBIT.",
  "text.cc8f8225a4c639723296": "Full-dilution ownership proxy with contractual preferred dividends retained; separate finance leases, noncontrolling claims and noncurrent investments.",
  "text.7b8624e48e51fcf7f96f": "GOOG common share; 2026-06-30 reported capital basis; explicit claims allocation; equal economic value across A/B/C classes",
  "text.74184b92072aff57980d": "Historical range · 10 annual observations IFRS Accounting Standards as issued by IASB",
  "text.36b9a7bcb6b31bcde982": "Historical range · 10 annual observations US GAAP; latest-reported annual facts as of dataset cutoff, not a point-in-time backtest",
  "text.1856db4c1014ae72bb07": "Historical range · 2 annual observations US GAAP; FY2025 recast continuing operations Only three comparable FY2025-recast continuing-operations years are available; older Yandex totals are not substituted. Only FY2023–FY2025 recast continuing operations are comparable. Old Yandex consolidated totals are excluded; FY2023 balance-sheet evidence is unavailable.",
  "text.61968c567732dcc36c07": "Historical returns provide context for your mature-business return assumption; they do not establish a perpetual return. Annual history is IASB IFRS in TWD; it is not interchangeable with the current TIFRS TTM series.",
  "text.99014c19d0bf4f2b38ef": "Historical returns provide context for your mature-business return assumption; they do not establish a perpetual return. This series is FY2025-recast continuing operations; old Yandex group totals are excluded.",
  "text.9913308d0b6eb4b0ea16": "June 30 actual Class A + Class B ordinary shares plus 21.065936m nominal-strike pre-funded warrant shares. Unvested participating issued shares remain within actual total; convertible/option dilution is not included.",
  "text.32f2974a3119391efba9": "Preferred dividends are assumed paid in cash. Stock-dividend shares, arrears additions and anti-dilution adjustments are excluded. Actual conversion depends on future 20-trading-day common-stock averages. The selected contractual endpoint is fixed, not inferred from the DCF value or a market quote.",
  "text.a31b164e1956fa571f79": "Reporting currency differs from USD quote currency; verified FX and ADR conversion must be applied before per-share comparison. TSM: reporting currency and depositary-share conversion require a verified model-specific mapping. Per-ADR valuation is withheld.",
  "text.92e347d7f83d1ae943bf": "Subsequent August 24, 2026 issuance of $5,750m convertible notes and exchange of $800m original principal for approximately 15.8m Class A shares materially supersedes this balance sheet/share count. Latest post-transaction carrying debt, cash and exact shares are unverified.",
  "text.b19bc9a1c9537245e273": "Subsequent financing and pre-funded warrants/equity claims are not reconciled to the balance-sheet share/debt/cash basis; current per-share valuation blocked.",
  "text.c07beb9202d4e54e16f7": "Subsequent financing and pre-funded warrants/equity claims are not reconciled to the balance-sheet share/debt/cash basis; current per-share valuation blocked. NBIS: business-perimeter comparability, funding and loss-to-profit mechanics require a specialist model. This simplified result is withheld.",
