  "text.c7c68ad3b093d3cfc3b3": "The capture includes current marketable equity; the source-specific bridge above supplies the corrected definition. Provisional debt base: current plus noncurrent carrying amounts where available; Apple commercial paper added; other short-term tags NOT automatically added because they may overlap. Micron includes finance leases. Review separate debt, lease and equity-claim components before valuation. Actual cover-date common shares, all common classes where applicable; existing awards require separate claims treatment; dated 2026-07-15.",
  "text.e379da4a722a3e4e343e": "The period-end fair value disclosed in the filing is an observed claim proxy, not a live convertible quote or a value re-estimated for each operating scenario.",
  "text.82ac6c7e0c353e4501eb": "US Treasury 10-year par yield / constant maturity (USD-only context; not a TWD risk-free rate)",
